        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal, ash slurry solids and bark chips, to landfarming</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, ash slurry solids and bark chips, to landfarming
Ash composition pig slurry: no information available, modelled equal to horse dung;
UUID: 065cf162-aaf2-4f38-b29e-a314a0f105c9
This data set includes the wood chips. Horse dung as a waste is assumed to be used with zero burden from its production.
Location: The inventory is modelled for a pilot plant in Switzerland
Technology: bark furnace 1MW
Time period: Collection of data and publication.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_065cf162-aaf2-4f38-b29e-a314a0f105c9.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
